cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mipR, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mipR: Measles Immunity Profiling by Birth Cohort, Area and Month"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Yusuf
    given-names: Mohamed A.
    email: moyusuf@who.int
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9339-4613"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/truenomad/mipR"
abstract: >-
  Provides a framework for reconstructing and projecting measles population
  immunity across birth cohorts, age groups, geographical units, and calendar
  months. The package integrates routine immunisation coverage, supplementary
  immunisation activities, and vaccine effectiveness assumptions to support
  spatiotemporal immunity profiling. Infection-acquired immunity and migration
  are not modelled.
keywords:
  - measles
  - population immunity
  - vaccination coverage
  - supplementary immunisation activities
  - R
